      "message": "similar to GenerateAndroidBuildActions, but not quite the same:\n\nDepsMutator is introduced in the android package, not in blueprint. So I think since this really is for all modules, this should go on ModuleBase directly.  In mutator.go, you\u0027ll want this:\n\n```\n  func depsMutator(ctx BottomUpMutatorContext) {\n  \tif m :\u003d ctx.Module(); m.Enabled() {\n+ \t\tm.base().baseDepsMutator()\n  \t\tm.DepsMutator(ctx)\n\t}\n}\n```",
